        "alt": "Business English: Improve your Communication for Work"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Effective communication is critical for any organisation. In organisations like AKU which use English in many work-related situations, it has become imperative to be able to communicate effectively through English. Indeed, a high level of English is considered an essential global skill. ELE_net's Business English courses provide you with a great opportunity to develop your English skills for business and work-related purposes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "We provide a blended learning approach integrating a British Council online course into our face-to-face classes. These classes are very interactive, engaging and, according to our previous course participants, a lot of fun!  "
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The language-rich content revolves around introductions and small talks, working with clients, handling feedback, discussing customer relations and networking, understanding different written communication, and giving a  presentation like a pro! You will also improve your pronunciation, fluency and accuracy when speaking in English."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Get ahead in your career and sign up for an ELE_net Business English course!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "https://www.aku.edu/ele-net/staff/Pages/Business_English.aspx",
